\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. My God, I am Thine;
\par What a comfort divine,
\par What a blessing to know 
\par that my Jesus is mine!
\par In the heavenly Lamb
\par Thrice happy I am,
\par And my heart it doth dance 
\par at the sound of His name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. True pleasures abound
\par In the rapturous sound;
\par And whoever hath found it 
\par hath paradise found.
\par My Jesus to know,
\par And feel to know,
\par 'Tis life everlasting, 
\par 'tis heaven below.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Yet onward I haste
\par To the heavenly feast:
\par That, that is the fullness; 
\par but this is the taste;
\par And this I shall prove,
\par Till with joy I remove
\par To the heaven of heavens 
\par in Jesus's love.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

